<title>UK: Citibank sets call warrants on Bouygues.</title>
<headline>Citibank sets call warrants on Bouygues.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank NA has issued two million call warrants, in two equal tranches, on Bouygues, lead manager Citibank SA said.</p>
<p>10 warrants control one share.</p>
<p> WARRANTS  STRIKE  ISS PRICE   PREMIUM     GEARING  MATURITY</p>
<p> CALL A    500     11.20 FFR    7.75 PCT   5.1 X    18.FEB.98</p>
<p> CALL B    575     11.60 FFR   21.65 PCT   4.9 X    18.FEB.00</p>
<p> PAYDATE 09.DEC.96	 LISTING PARIS	 MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
